{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37456","headline":"鸂鶒 · 唐彦谦","name":"鸂鶒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一宿南塘烟雨时，好风摇动绿波微。\n惊离晓岸冲花去，暖下春汀照影飞。\n华屋捻弦弹鼓舞，绮窗含笔澹毛衣。\n画屏见後长回首，争得雕笼莫放归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37456.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37456","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}